    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/838b13ba74927cf909432ec5847fac1a.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/838b13ba74927cf909432ec5847fac1a.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/838b13ba74927cf909432ec5847fac1a.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Nowhere</strong> is a Nordic inspired narrative mystery/horror game. Focusing on immersive and atmospheric creepy Scandinavian locations and a realistic investigation system, you play a detective trapped in the forests of Norway while searching for a group of missing tourists when you find there's more to the story than meets the eye. Tension slowly builds as you explore the world, never shaking the feeling you're being watched. Nowhere uses a unique blend of detective gameplay and survival horror in Nordic aesthetics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/75249fa754b4656baa954eca53b1438b.avif?t=1724233650\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/4534aef7264b97c36f70495c6f849332.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/4534aef7264b97c36f70495c6f849332.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/4534aef7264b97c36f70495c6f849332.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/0255c43e71c59ef84d6524d49cf724f1.avif?t=1724233650\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br><br>A unique tale on Norse mythology, the conflicts of religion during the Viking Age and what happened to the Gods in the final years of their worship.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/21fccb0f9125c98a88631b3f6caaafb3.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/21fccb0f9125c98a88631b3f6caaafb3.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/21fccb0f9125c98a88631b3f6caaafb3.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A blend of Detective Mystery and Survival Horror filled with suspense and slow build ups of tension, not jumpscares.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/26d0e2e5d94e08979cac0ed654942b2c.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/26d0e2e5d94e08979cac0ed654942b2c.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/26d0e2e5d94e08979cac0ed654942b2c.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Non-Linear Open World exploring all the atmospheric and creepy locations across the forests.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/cfd22ee5b4dc27b73befac9d95af8c78.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/cfd22ee5b4dc27b73befac9d95af8c78.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/cfd22ee5b4dc27b73befac9d95af8c78.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Realistic Investigation Mechanics that will make you feel like a real detective.  The game relies on you to make your own connections and work things out for yourself, giving you the ability to interact with the environments around you, searching for clues, inspecting sites of interest while making your investigations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/b7d8cfdabac8c9e5fc1a63cac5e3ddfa.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/b7d8cfdabac8c9e5fc1a63cac5e3ddfa.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/b7d8cfdabac8c9e5fc1a63cac5e3ddfa.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the sound of a horn in the distance, the forests around you twist and corrupt into a nightmare version of itself. The monsters stalking you from the shadows, waiting until your back is turned. Run! Hide! Fight! Survive!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/81fbeb02f179ddeee0d2e15f93b54c07.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/81fbeb02f179ddeee0d2e15f93b54c07.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/81fbeb02f179ddeee0d2e15f93b54c07.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/838b13ba74927cf909432ec5847fac1a.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/838b13ba74927cf909432ec5847fac1a.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/838b13ba74927cf909432ec5847fac1a.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Nowhere</strong> is a Nordic inspired narrative mystery/horror game. Focusing on immersive and atmospheric creepy Scandinavian locations and a realistic investigation system, you play a detective trapped in the forests of Norway while searching for a group of missing tourists when you find there's more to the story than meets the eye. Tension slowly builds as you explore the world, never shaking the feeling you're being watched. Nowhere uses a unique blend of detective gameplay and survival horror in Nordic aesthetics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/75249fa754b4656baa954eca53b1438b.avif?t=1724233650\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/4534aef7264b97c36f70495c6f849332.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/4534aef7264b97c36f70495c6f849332.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/4534aef7264b97c36f70495c6f849332.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/0255c43e71c59ef84d6524d49cf724f1.avif?t=1724233650\" width=616 height=71 /></span><br><br><br>A unique tale on Norse mythology, the conflicts of religion during the Viking Age and what happened to the Gods in the final years of their worship.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/21fccb0f9125c98a88631b3f6caaafb3.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/21fccb0f9125c98a88631b3f6caaafb3.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/21fccb0f9125c98a88631b3f6caaafb3.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A blend of Detective Mystery and Survival Horror filled with suspense and slow build ups of tension, not jumpscares.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/26d0e2e5d94e08979cac0ed654942b2c.poster.avif?t=1724233650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/26d0e2e5d94e08979cac0ed654942b2c.webm?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743260/extras/26d0e2e5d94e08979cac0ed654942b2c.mp4?t=1724233650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Non-Linear Open World exploring all the atmospheric and creepy locations across the forests.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/